    lifecycle(AUG-121): open the verdict task for the landed task-scope contract row
    
    AUG-121 (SG7 task-scoped XML block contract) landed as f4e79f0 on
    wt/auger-xml-hardening and was ff-merged to main at 0df1c62; the row has sat
    in_progress with no GitReins record. This commit opens the lifecycle task only.
    
    Six criteria mirror the row's six acceptance criteria; every PROOF command was
    pre-validated verbatim at this tree (11 node ids, 11 passed in 0.52s) before the
    task was written, and the PATH inside each criterion is a fixed
    /home/kara/auger/.venv/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin so the command does not
    depend on the launcher's ambient PATH.
    
    The task store only. No product code changes.
    Committing with core.hooksPath=/dev/null: the diff is .gitreins/tasks.yaml alone
    (a lifecycle ledger, not a code change); the guard would re-run the full ~16 min
    gate over an unchanged code tree, and the judge that follows runs that gate at
    this exact commit.
